  "description": "Shine Kim, whom transfer student Seon Yu-Byeol likes, is a famous running star at school. He has a handsome face, great athleticism, and even an evil girlfriend!\n'If I get a little bit faster than I am now, and if I get to be faster than Shine Kim, will you look at me?'\nA youthful growth drama about Seon Yu-Byeol, a running genius who is more interested in ash than running, Shin Kim, a running fool who only knows about running, and boys and girls in the athletics club. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
